The '''Vanquisher''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns rarely in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Vanquishers''' have a base chance of {{Green|1/640}} to spawn when any enemy is killed in the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}. It gains heavy damage resistance against all player attacks within the first few seconds of spawning.

Multiple factors can increase the chance of a '''Vanquisher''' spawning:
*After {{Green|640}}, {{Green|960}}, and {{Green|1,280}} mobs are killed without spawning a '''Vanquisher''', the chances are increased.
*The {{Item|Kuudra Pet}}'s {{AN|Wither Bait}} perk increases the chances for a '''Vanquisher''' to spawn by {{Green|0.1-20%}}.
*{{Attr|Crimson Serendipity}} ({{Item|Inferno Koi Shard}}) increases the chances for a '''Vanquisher''' to spawn by {{Green|2-20%}}.
*Since '''Vanquishers''' are {{mt|Elusive}}, the chances for a Vanquisher to spawn are affected by {{Stat|tracking}}.

