== Trivia ==
*Like vanilla [[mcw:Wither|Withers]], '''Vanquishers''' become immune to arrow damage after reaching {{Stat|Health|50%}}.
*Because '''Vanquishers''' are Withers, they are particularly vulnerable to damage dealt with {{Item|Necron's Blade}} and its variants.

